# Prospektor

> Give Prospektor your website and it finds the companies worth approaching
> (new customers, distribution partners, resellers, companies worth investing
> in), names the people at each one to write to, and writes what you send them.
> The writing is the product: a deck, a one-pager, a cold email and a proposal
> in one client's voice, grounded in the work that client has already won.

This domain is the marketing site: what the product is, and what it costs. Every
page a visitor reads (the front page, the two product pages, pricing, checkout,
contact) is also served in
