## The price

US$999 a month, per workspace, paid before you start, or US$9,990 for a year,
which is two months free and fixed for that year. A workspace is one company
you are selling for, so an agency selling for five clients keeps five. Runs are
included and every colleague on your work-email domain is too: no seats to
count, no credit meter. A few presses have a daily ceiling per workspace (100
glances a day, for one), and the help lists each. Money back if it doesn't earn
its keep. If the price ever changes, customers get at least 30 days' notice and it applies from the next renewal,
never to a period already paid for.
[prospektor.ai/pricing/](https://prospektor.ai/pricing/) answers the rest of the
money questions.

## What it does

The studio's menu is four questions, and every screen answers one of them.

- **Who?** *Leads for you*: companies worth approaching, each with the reason it fits. *Research*: read one company, find more like your customers, or run a whole list of up to 100. *Counterprospekt*: who buys from your competitors, each client with the page that names it.
- **Who at them?** *Decision-makers*: the people to write to, a name only where a source backs it.
- **Who can walk you in?** *Warm intros*: who in your network can introduce you, with the ask and the email they send on, both drafted.
- **What to say?** *The pitch*: a deck, a one-pager, a cold email and a proposal, in your voice, with numbers only from your brief or a cited source. *Inbound*: the reply to a lead who wrote to you, and a call sheet in about a minute. *Library*: every pitch, ready to share or push to your CRM.

A *glance* takes about 15 seconds and answers whether a company is worth a full
pitch: a fit score, the one argument, signals for and against, and the roles to
approach. Who to pitch is free to try; what to send is what you are paying for.
The studio drafts and checks. You send. Nothing signs your name but you. The
two halves in full: [prospektor.ai/who-to-pitch/](https://prospektor.ai/who-to-pitch/)
and [prospektor.ai/what-to-send/](https://prospektor.ai/what-to-send/).

